NOTE ON BUNDLED SOFTWARE

The BalOS ISO ships configuration, scripts, and build tooling under this MIT
license, BUT it also redistributes many third-party packages (kernels,
userspace, desktop environments, pentesting tools, etc.) under their own
licenses — GPL-2, GPL-3, LGPL, Apache-2, BSD, MPL, and others. Those packages
retain their original licenses; see individual package metadata for details.

NOTE ON OFFENSIVE SECURITY TOOLS

BalOS bundles offensive security tooling. Using that tooling against systems
you do not own or lack written authorization to test is illegal in most
jurisdictions. The authors disclaim all liability for misuse.
